[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172699955","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/109482#issuecomment-3172699955","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/109482","id":3172699955,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc69G48z","user":{"login":"RedMser","id":5117197,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxMTcxOTc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5117197?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser","html_url":"https://github.com/RedMser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RedMser/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-10T15:09:38Z","updated_at":"2025-08-11T00:18:58Z","body":"The JSON class [already handles this correctly](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/66170), so only the escape method must be updated.\n\nIdeally, `json_escape` should try to use the \"short-form\" escape codes where available:\n\n```\n0x08 -> \\b\n0x09 -> \\t\n0x0A -> \\n\n0x0C -> \\f\n0x0D -> \\r\n```\n\nAll other cases from `U+0000 - U+001F` should use `\\uXXXX` escape notation.\n\nEDIT: Seems like the method currently converts `\\v` to `\\\\v` which is NOT a valid JSON escape code! It must be converted to `\\u000B` instead.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3172699955/reactions","total